[00:01.00]Today, Jehovah God,
[00:05.04]we stand before your throne,
[00:10.16]For you showed the greatest love
[00:14.84]that could ever be shown.
[00:21.20]You gave the gift of your dear Son,
[00:26.56]that we might live.
[00:30.58]No greater sacrifice than this
[00:35.38]could you ever give.
[00:39.07](Chorus)
[00:39.22]He gave his life to set us free.
[00:45.34]His precious blood provides the key.
[00:51.16]With all our hearts,
[00:53.36]we’ll go on thanking you eternally.
[00:59.84]It was a willing sacrifice
[01:07.60]that Jesus made.
[01:12.04]Out of love, his perfect life
[01:16.38]was the price that he paid.
[01:22.56]We had no hope until he came
[01:28.19]to save mankind.
[01:32.12]But now our hope is finding life,
[01:36.90]leaving death behind.
[01:40.71](Chorus)
[01:40.86]He gave his life to set us free.
[01:46.78]His precious blood provides the key.
[01:52.66]With all our hearts,
[01:54.90]we’ll go on thanking you eternally.
